Posting notes for the coordinator: this is a local draft, not a posted comment. At drafting time raw-quality artifacts are newer than v4 and pending their own canonical publication. Add the new immutable quality/report link after that append exists; do not link v4 as the source of these new quality counts. The source records are `quality/raw-quality-review-v1/{README.md,review.json}`, `root/RAW-QUALITY-FAILURE-SCOPE-REVIEW-v1.md` and `groupfx/batch-invariant-audit-v1/SOURCE-AUDIT.md`. Keep the issue open as a known limitation rather than describing these follow-up checkboxes as a claim that the three errors have been fixed.
